599
00:33:38,079 --> 00:33:39,359
you would make her

600
00:33:39,359 --> 00:33:39,900
unable to stay

601
00:33:39,900 --> 00:33:41,000
in Nanhuai.

602
00:33:41,440 --> 00:33:43,440
You'd make her life worse than death.

603
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,380
You said

604
00:33:47,079 --> 00:33:49,400
you'd take her life.

605
00:34:02,380 --> 00:34:03,180
Well?

606
00:34:05,940 --> 00:34:06,940
Speak.

607
00:34:09,340 --> 00:34:10,280
Cat got your tongue?

608
00:34:11,340 --> 00:34:12,679
Why won't you talk?

609
00:34:12,980 --> 00:34:14,000
Talk to me!

610
00:34:14,500 --> 00:34:15,400
Talk to me!

611
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:16,380
Please!

612
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:18,199
You insolent girl!

613
00:34:19,579 --> 00:34:20,500
Are you all right?

614
00:34:30,500 --> 00:34:31,880
Since I was little,

615
00:34:33,900 --> 00:34:34,699
you never even

616
00:34:34,699 --> 00:34:36,400
had the heart to speak harshly to me.

617
00:34:39,539 --> 00:34:41,079
Now you strike me

618
00:34:41,079 --> 00:34:42,539
for these two people

619
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:46,000
of unknown origin.

620
00:34:46,579 --> 00:34:47,380
Ziyi,

621
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:48,360
I...

622
00:34:48,639 --> 00:34:50,380
I can explain.

623
00:34:50,380 --> 00:34:52,139
I would never...

624
00:34:53,079 --> 00:34:54,679
I'll kill you today!

625
00:34:55,179 --> 00:34:56,539
You ruined everything!

626
00:34:56,739 --> 00:34:57,739
You ruined me!

627
00:34:57,739 --> 00:34:58,099
Let go!

628
00:34:58,099 --> 00:34:59,300
I'll kill you!

629
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:00,679
I'll kill you!

630
00:35:00,980 --> 00:35:02,000
I'll kill you!

631
00:35:02,340 --> 00:35:03,599
I'll kill you!

632
00:35:03,840 --> 00:35:05,139
I'll kill you!

633
00:35:05,480 --> 00:35:06,400
Calm yourself.

634
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:07,800
This is a hospital.

635
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:09,480
Yu Changxuan?

636
00:35:15,239 --> 00:35:16,599
Seeing you is harder

637
00:35:17,980 --> 00:35:19,599
than climbing to heaven.

638
00:35:21,900 --> 00:35:24,079
But the moment anything happens to her,

639
00:35:25,900 --> 00:35:27,280
you panic like this.

640
00:35:30,539 --> 00:35:32,539
You were born to destroy me!

641
00:35:33,599 --> 00:35:35,460
You stole my fiancé,

642
00:35:37,119 --> 00:35:39,079
and now you steal my father!

643
00:35:39,519 --> 00:35:40,239
Everyone sides

644
00:35:40,239 --> 00:35:41,460
with her

645
00:35:41,659 --> 00:35:43,300
and gangs up on me.

646
00:35:47,179 --> 00:35:48,300
I tell you,

647
00:35:49,340 --> 00:35:50,059
I, Tao Ziyi,

648
00:35:50,059 --> 00:35:51,500
will not endure this.

649
00:35:52,099 --> 00:35:53,980
I will make you all regret it!

650
00:35:55,139 --> 00:35:55,739
Ziyi!

651
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:56,639
Ziyi!

652
00:35:59,139 --> 00:35:59,639
Pingjun!

653
00:35:59,699 --> 00:36:00,300
Pingjun!

654
00:36:00,380 --> 00:36:01,039
Pingjun!

655
00:36:01,159 --> 00:36:01,880
Pingjun!

656
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:02,739
Get out!

657
00:36:04,179 --> 00:36:05,820
Get out!

658
00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:07,679
Pingjun!

659
00:36:08,139 --> 00:36:08,940
Pingjun!

660
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:10,079
Mr. Tao,

661
00:36:10,980 --> 00:36:11,960
under the circumstances,

662
00:36:12,280 --> 00:36:13,500
you should leave.

663
00:36:28,039 --> 00:36:28,840
What?

664
00:36:29,539 --> 00:36:30,539
So Changxuan

665
00:36:31,039 --> 00:36:32,199
broke off

666
00:36:32,199 --> 00:36:33,380
with Tao Ziyi,

667
00:36:33,880 --> 00:36:34,699
and then Uncle Tao,

668
00:36:34,699 --> 00:36:36,380
to avenge her,

669
00:36:36,380 --> 00:36:37,980
nearly drowned Ye Pingjun,

670
00:36:38,300 --> 00:36:40,139
only for a twist of fate

671
00:36:40,300 --> 00:36:41,199
to reveal that

672
00:36:41,199 --> 00:36:42,440
Ye Pingjun is his

673
00:36:42,440 --> 00:36:43,679
own biological daughter?

674
00:36:45,079 --> 00:36:46,179
My goodness.

675
00:36:46,599 --> 00:36:48,460
It's just like a stage play.

676
00:36:48,940 --> 00:36:50,780
Those three words fit perfectly:

677
00:36:51,039 --> 00:36:52,480
tangled by fate.

678
00:36:53,139 --> 00:36:54,500
Don't talk nonsense.

679
00:36:55,539 --> 00:36:57,780
Your father doesn't know yet.

680
00:36:57,840 --> 00:36:59,159
If he finds out,

681
00:36:59,639 --> 00:37:00,739
he'll be furious.

682
00:37:00,880 --> 00:37:02,940
But this has already caused

683
00:37:02,940 --> 00:37:04,719
an uproar at Ren'ai Hospital.

684
00:37:05,179 --> 00:37:05,960
I heard

685
00:37:06,340 --> 00:37:08,179
Tao Ziyi even came to blows.

686
00:37:08,880 --> 00:37:10,099
The whole place was turned upside down.

687
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:14,500
What's all this uproar?

688
00:37:31,539 --> 00:37:32,340
Go on.

689
00:37:39,380 --> 00:37:40,400
Damn that boy.

690
00:37:41,079 --> 00:37:42,599
He was the one who insisted

691
00:37:42,599 --> 00:37:44,179
on being with Tao Ziyi,

692
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:47,900
and now he ends it just like that,

693
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:49,940
causing such a scene.

694
00:37:50,880 --> 00:37:52,139
That brat

695
00:37:53,139 --> 00:37:54,739
keeps pulling these reckless stunts.

696
00:37:56,139 --> 00:37:57,460
Calm down first.

697
00:37:57,739 --> 00:37:59,340
Don't harm your health.

698
00:37:59,900 --> 00:38:01,340
Miss Ye is educated,

699
00:38:01,699 --> 00:38:03,880
refined, and generous.

700
00:38:04,239 --> 00:38:05,900
I quite like her.

701
00:38:06,340 --> 00:38:07,699
Didn't you praise her

702
00:38:07,699 --> 00:38:09,079
recently yourself?

703
00:38:09,500 --> 00:38:12,340
You said she dared stand firm before

704
00:38:12,340 --> 00:38:15,039
Chu Wenfu and argue Changxuan's case

705
00:38:15,039 --> 00:38:15,880
without yielding an inch.

706
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:17,380
She had real spirit.

707
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:20,980
Besides,

708
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:22,800
our families were already going to be

709
00:38:22,940 --> 00:38:24,420
connected through marriage.

710
00:38:24,539 --> 00:38:26,780
Why not let Changxuan have his way?

711
00:38:27,179 --> 00:38:29,199
We could be happy to see it.

712
00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:30,699
It's not that simple.

713
00:38:32,380 --> 00:38:33,699
I still don't know

714
00:38:34,239 --> 00:38:34,860
how to explain myself

715
00:38:34,860 --> 00:38:35,940
to Tao Xili.

716
00:38:37,099 --> 00:38:39,079
He is a clever man.

717
00:38:39,579 --> 00:38:41,679
Surely he can see how the ledger balances.

718
00:38:43,900 --> 00:38:45,179
Let's wait and see.

719
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,480
Wait and see.

720
00:38:56,039 --> 00:38:56,840
Please,

721
00:38:58,340 --> 00:39:00,340
say something.

722
00:39:01,900 --> 00:39:02,880
I know

723
00:39:03,900 --> 00:39:05,519
it's all my fault.

724
00:39:06,539 --> 00:39:08,280
I shouldn't have kept it from you.

725
00:39:11,039 --> 00:39:12,300
Say something,

726
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:13,780
won't you?

727
00:39:16,139 --> 00:39:17,400
Please.

728
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:02,440
You stayed here all night?

729
00:42:03,380 --> 00:42:04,860
I thought if you woke

730
00:42:05,219 --> 00:42:06,519
and wanted someone to talk to,

731
00:42:07,320 --> 00:42:08,380
I'd be right here.

732
00:42:13,559 --> 00:42:14,420
Yu Changxuan,

733
00:42:16,619 --> 00:42:17,380
thank you.

734
00:42:22,579 --> 00:42:23,380
I know

735
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:28,179
you must be heartbroken

736
00:42:29,699 --> 00:42:30,420
and in pain,

737
00:42:32,260 --> 00:42:34,059
but you haven't done anything wrong.

738
00:42:35,820 --> 00:42:37,420
There's no need to punish yourself

739
00:42:38,980 --> 00:42:40,019
for someone else's mistakes.

740
00:42:44,659 --> 00:42:45,679
All these years,

741
00:42:49,239 --> 00:42:51,139
no matter how hard life was,

742
00:42:52,519 --> 00:42:54,179
I did everything I could

743
00:42:56,420 --> 00:42:58,559
to give my mother a better life.

744
00:43:00,019 --> 00:43:02,119
I wanted to be my father's pride,

745
00:43:05,079 --> 00:43:06,099
to become as fine a person

746
00:43:06,099 --> 00:43:07,360
as he was.

747
00:43:11,199 --> 00:43:12,239
Now

748
00:43:13,960 --> 00:43:15,079
I find

749
00:43:19,679 --> 00:43:21,179
it was all a joke.

750
00:43:30,119 --> 00:43:30,980
Do you remember

751
00:43:32,760 --> 00:43:34,659
my elder brother, the one I mentioned

752
00:43:36,360 --> 00:43:37,460
at Guanyin Pavilion?

753
00:43:41,480 --> 00:43:42,380
There are things

754
00:43:43,920 --> 00:43:44,719
I've kept hidden

755
00:43:46,960 --> 00:43:48,460
for years.

756
00:43:52,760 --> 00:43:54,300
Once, my brother and I

757
00:43:55,099 --> 00:43:56,300
went into battle together

758
00:43:56,940 --> 00:43:58,400
and were caught in an enemy raid.

759
00:43:59,820 --> 00:44:00,760
We were both buried

760
00:44:00,760 --> 00:44:01,760
under rubble.

761
00:44:02,920 --> 00:44:04,019
The situation was so desperate

762
00:44:04,860 --> 00:44:05,980
that only one of us could be saved.

763
00:44:07,659 --> 00:44:08,880
My father saved my brother

764
00:44:10,719 --> 00:44:11,880
and gave me up.

765
00:44:15,360 --> 00:44:16,619
But fate played its cruel hand.

766
00:44:18,460 --> 00:44:19,380
My brother died,

767
00:44:21,139 --> 00:44:22,260
and I survived.

768
00:44:26,760 --> 00:44:27,860
He was outstanding.

769
00:44:29,059 --> 00:44:30,260
From childhood,

770
00:44:31,539 --> 00:44:32,519
he had

771
00:44:32,519 --> 00:44:33,699
everyone's attention

772
00:44:34,980 --> 00:44:36,940
and was my father's chosen successor.

773
00:44:41,039 --> 00:44:41,920
For a time,

774
00:44:41,920 --> 00:44:42,940
I treated him as a rival,

775
00:44:44,119 --> 00:44:45,519
comparing myself to him at every turn,

776
00:44:46,760 --> 00:44:48,019
trying to catch up

777
00:44:49,059 --> 00:44:49,980
and beat him.

778
00:44:51,780 --> 00:44:53,780
I grew used to chasing his back.

779
00:44:55,780 --> 00:44:56,579
So

780
00:44:58,219 --> 00:44:59,320
after he died,

781
00:45:01,059 --> 00:45:02,059
everything in my life

782
00:45:04,460 --> 00:45:05,400
suddenly seemed

783
00:45:05,400 --> 00:45:06,500
to lose meaning.

784
00:45:18,179 --> 00:45:19,079
What happened then?

785
00:45:28,059 --> 00:45:29,559
Then I met a girl.

786
00:45:30,519 --> 00:45:31,760
She taught me

787
00:45:33,880 --> 00:45:34,840
not to be trapped

788
00:45:34,840 --> 00:45:36,719
in empty, unreal obsessions,

789
00:45:38,039 --> 00:45:39,840
that one should live for oneself

790
00:45:42,000 --> 00:45:43,500
and not need to prove

791
00:45:43,920 --> 00:45:46,219
the worth of one's life to others.

792
00:45:50,260 --> 00:45:51,119
You've written so many

793
00:45:51,119 --> 00:45:52,760
passionate stage lines,

794
00:45:54,760 --> 00:45:56,780
taught orphans to read and write,

795
00:45:57,079 --> 00:45:57,960
and given so many people

796
00:45:57,960 --> 00:45:59,920
the dignity and courage to keep living.

797
00:46:00,880 --> 00:46:03,360
Did you do all that merely to prove

798
00:46:03,920 --> 00:46:05,440
you were a good daughter to your father?

799
00:46:06,800 --> 00:46:08,119
Because the image of your father

800
00:46:08,119 --> 00:46:08,940
has collapsed,

801
00:46:09,480 --> 00:46:10,179
do you truly have

802
00:46:10,179 --> 00:46:11,460
no courage or strength

803
00:46:11,659 --> 00:46:12,519
to stand

804
00:46:13,980 --> 00:46:15,219
and walk on?

805
00:46:19,739 --> 00:46:20,360
Listen,

806
00:46:22,699 --> 00:46:23,320
you've always

807
00:46:23,320 --> 00:46:24,639
had clear judgment.

808
00:46:26,880 --> 00:46:28,059
You'll work this through.

809
00:46:30,980 --> 00:46:31,579
If a relationship

810
00:46:31,579 --> 00:46:32,920
harms you,

811
00:46:34,559 --> 00:46:35,559
you can keep your distance

812
00:46:35,559 --> 00:46:36,659
from it,

813
00:46:37,659 --> 00:46:38,460
even

814
00:46:39,179 --> 00:46:40,880
redefine it.

815
00:46:42,559 --> 00:46:44,019
You don't have to be

816
00:46:44,780 --> 00:46:46,239
bound by the so-called ties of blood.

817
00:46:47,820 --> 00:46:48,960
What matters now

818
00:46:50,260 --> 00:46:51,760
is living your own life well.

819
00:47:15,780 --> 00:47:16,400
Look,

820
00:47:18,099 --> 00:47:19,539
the sun rises every day.

821
00:47:22,119 --> 00:47:23,119
However long the night,

822
00:47:25,559 --> 00:47:26,679
it always passes.

823
00:47:49,199 --> 00:47:50,340
Your future

824
00:47:51,639 --> 00:47:53,559
holds so many good things

825
00:47:54,519 --> 00:47:55,639
waiting for you.

826
00:48:09,880 --> 00:48:10,820
[Ye Pingjun,]

827
00:48:11,679 --> 00:48:12,940
[I've finally found you.]

828
00:48:14,300 --> 00:48:15,219
[From now on,]

829
00:48:16,980 --> 00:48:18,480
[I will never let you leave again.]
